<SiteLayout
  title="Before we start | Otter Alongside | Otter Homecare"
  description="Thinking about care for someone you love: how to raise it with them, what happens when you ring us, what it costs, and the help you may be entitled to."
>
<section class="als-hero">
  <div class="als-wrap">
    <nav class="als-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>·</span><a href="/support-for-families">For families</a><span>·</span><a href="/family">Otter Alongside</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="als-hero__inner">
    <div class="als-hero__body">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-teal">Otter Alongside · Stage 1 of 6</p>
      <h1 class="als-hero__title">Before we start</h1>
      <p class="als-hero__lede">Thinking about care for someone you love — how to raise it with them, what actually happens when you ring, and what it costs.</p>
      <div class="als-hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022">Ring us — 01225 690022</a>
        <a class="als-hero__skip" href="#not-yet">You might not need us yet</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="als-hero__media">
      <img src="/img/alongside/photos/deciding.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional painting a client's nails in his own front room, both of them smiling.">
      <div class="als-hero__aside"><p>Ringing us doesn't commit you to anything.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Stage rail ======================================================= -->
<nav class="als-stages" aria-label="Otter Alongside stages" data-print="hide">
  <div class="als-stages__inner">
    <span class="als-stage als-stage--current" aria-current="page">
      <span class="als-stage__num">1</span>
      <span class="als-stage__label">Before we start<span class="als-stage__here">You are here</span></span>
    </span>
    <a class="als-stage" href="/family/your-first-month">
      <span class="als-stage__num">2</span>
      <span class="als-stage__label">Your first month</span>
    </a>
    <a class="als-stage" href="/family/living-with-it"><span class="als-stage__num">3</span><span class="als-stage__label">Living with it</span></a>
    <a class="als-stage" href="/family/when-things-change"><span class="als-stage__num">4</span><span class="als-stage__label">When things change</span></a>
    <a class="als-stage" href="/family/looking-after-you"><span class="als-stage__num">5</span><span class="als-stage__label">Looking after you</span></a>
    <a class="als-stage" href="/family/the-last-part"><span class="als-stage__num">6</span><span class="als-stage__label">The last part</span></a>
  </div>
